== brief
READ-ONLY review. Return the report as your final message — plain text, NOT a
task handle. Do NOT write or modify any file: this is a live PR worktree and a
previous run wrote into one, then stalled without delivering.


WORKTREE: <SB>/home/RustroverProjects/velostream (head <sha>)

    git -C <SB>/home/RustroverProjects/velostream diff origin/master...HEAD
    gh pr view 12 --repo velostreamai/velostream --comments

SCOPE: exactly that range. This is the first review of this PR.

--- WHAT IT DOES -------------------------------------------------------------
what this PR does
--- END SCOPE ----------------------------------------------------------------

## ATTACK

<<< FILL THIS IN — the specific things worth this reviewer's effort. >>>
<<< A generic checklist produces a generic review. Name the shapes that would  >>>
<<< actually break this change, and any claim the author made that rests on    >>>
<<< reasoning rather than evidence.                                            >>>

## Also confirm

- no src/ file touched unless the change is meant to touch src/
- cargo fmt --all -- --check is clean
- any ratchet, floor or manifest in the diff still holds

IGNORE Kafka/integration failures — a known broker container-lifecycle race,
unrelated, passes in isolation.

OUTPUT — plain text, final message:

## Codex review — PR 12 @ <sha>
**Verdict:** approve | approve-with-findings | blocked

### Findings
Severity, file:line, the claim, and a concrete failure scenario. Say whether you
REPRODUCED it or it is reasoning-only.

### Refutation attempts that FAILED

Mark anything unverifiable as UNVERIFIED. Be brief — a short report with two
real findings beats a long one with eight speculative ones.

